  "behavioral_change": "numpy v_old 1.26.4 to v_new 2.0.2 (cluster CL-numpy2-dtype-promotion). Under NEP 50 promotion (numpy.result_type), the float64 spacing=np.ones(ndim) used inside moments_central promotes the whole float32 moment computation to float64.",
